    class Item3
    {
        dataType="Comment";
        class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-5};};
        title="Enable Waldo_SupplyTransfers_Enable and Waldo_PhysicalCargo_Enable in MissionConfig/logisticsConfig.sqf. The two crates and NATO Prowler/DAGOR share one transfer/merge system. Carry a crate with ACE to try visible mounting. WMP checks model seat proxies on the first mount and locks only seats it can identify. No seat coordinates belong in this Init field. Keep vehicle simulation and collision on. Wikis: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Supply-Transfers and https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Physical-Cargo";
